// ---- Pillar 5 Step 3 (head writer W2): P3's T2 form (seat H2): a note that rules out less than it seems. The part
// went in but never really worked, so that cause is NOT crossed off. {part} the part, {shows} the card's symptom
// ("leaks", "runs cool"). H2 adds " — Surname". Every line says "the wrong size" (H2's puzzle_check looks for it).
== fault.tried.odd
- Put in a {part} from the old stock: the wrong size, it never seated. Still {shows}.
- Fitted a {part} from a crate marked "spares?". The wrong size. Still {shows}.
- Tried a {part}, the wrong size. Had to bodge the fitting. Still {shows}.
